# Alur Kerja Sistem: ACS Intelligence Assistant (MVP Version)

Dokumen ini menjelaskan **arsitektur** dan **alur kerja** sebenarnya dari sistem ACS Intelligence Assistant berdasarkan kode yang telah diimplementasikan saat ini — mulai dari pengguna masuk, mengunggah dokumen, hingga berinteraksi dengan AI.

---

## 1. Arsitektur Umum (High-Level)

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph FRONTEND["🖥️ Frontend (Next.js)"]
        UI["User Interface"]
        Hooks["Custom Hooks<br/>(useChat, useRAG, useSession)"]
        Types["Types (chat.ts)"]
    end

    subgraph BACKEND["⚙️ Backend (Express.js)"]
        MW["Middleware<br/>(Auth, Validation, Error)"]
        Routes["Routes<br/>(auth, chat, document, health)"]
        Controllers["Controllers<br/>(auth, chat, document, session, feedback)"]
        Services["Services Layer<br/>(8 core services)"]
    end

    subgraph EXTERNAL["🌐 External Services"]
        Groq["Groq API<br/>(gpt-oss-120b)"]
        PG["PostgreSQL + pgvector<br/>(Prisma ORM)"]
        Tika["Apache Tika / LlamaParse<br/>(Document Extraction)"]
        Redis["Redis<br/>(Caching & Session)"]
    end

    UI --> Hooks
    Hooks --> Routes
    Routes --> MW --> Controllers --> Services
    Services --> Groq
    Services --> PG
    Services --> Tika
    Services --> Redis
```

---

## 2. Alur Autentikasi

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant AUTH as /api/auth
    participant MW as Auth Middleware
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>FE: Masukkan email & password
    FE->>AUTH: POST /api/auth/login
    AUTH->>DB: Cek kredensial (bcrypt)
    DB-->>AUTH: User data
    AUTH-->>FE: { accessToken, refreshToken, user }
    FE->>FE: Simpan kredensial & state

    Note over FE,MW: Setiap request dilindungi...

    FE->>MW: Request + Bearer Token
    MW->>MW: Verify JWT
    MW->>MW: Set req.user
    MW-->>FE: ✅ Authorized / ❌ 401
```

| Endpoint | Method | Fungsi |
|---|---|---|
| `/api/auth/register` | POST | Mendaftarkan akun user baru |
| `/api/auth/login` | POST | Login, dapat access & refresh token |
| `/api/auth/verify` | GET | Cek validitas token login saat ini |
| `/api/auth/refresh` | POST | Mendapatkan token baru lewat refresh token |
| `/api/auth/quick-refresh` | POST | Refresh token cepat |

---

## 3. Alur Chat & Query AI (RAG)

Ini adalah **alur utama** saat pengguna mengajukan pertanyaan ke model gpt-oss-120b.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["👤 User mengetik pertanyaan"] --> C["POST /api/chat/universal<br>atau /api/chat/stream"]

    C --> G["chatController"]

    G --> K["Services Layer"]

    K --> L["rag.service<br/>Cari konteks dokumen"]
    K --> M["groq.service<br/>Kirim prompt ke gpt-oss-120b"]

    L --> P["PostgreSQL (pgvector)<br/>(Vector Similarity Search)"]
    M --> Q["Groq API"]

    P --> R["Context Merger"]
    Q --> R

    R --> S["Response stream ke CLI / Web UI"]
    S --> T["👤 User melihat jawaban"]
```

### Detail Endpoint Chat & Fitur Terkait

| Endpoint | Method | Fungsi Utama | Controller |
|---|---|---|---|
| `/api/chat/universal` | POST | Mengirim pesan (non-stream) ke AI RAG | `chatController` |
| `/api/chat/stream` | POST | Meminta balasan AI secara streaming | `chatController` |
| `/api/chat/sessions` | GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE | CRUD Manajemen Sesi Obrolan | `sessionController` |
| `/api/chat/history/:id` | GET | Mengambil riwayat percakapan sesi | `sessionController` |
| `/api/chat/feedback` | POST/GET | Memberikan/Melihat Rating jawaban AI | `feedbackController` |

---

## 4. Alur Upload & Manajemen Dokumen (RAG Pipeline)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend (useRAG)
    participant API as /api/document
    participant DOC as documentController
    participant SVC as document-extractor.service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (pgvector)

    Note over U,DB: 📤 Upload Dokumen

    U->>FE: Pilih file PDF/TXT/DOCX
    FE->>API: POST /api/document/documents (multipart Multer)
    API->>DOC: uploadDocuments()
    DOC->>SVC: Ekstraksi teks (Tika / LlamaParse)
    SVC->>SVC: Chunking dokumen teks
    SVC->>SVC: embedding.service (Buat Emdedding)
    SVC->>DB: Insert ke tabel DocumentChunk (vector(384))
    SVC->>DB: Simpan tabel Document metadata
    DOC-->>FE: ✅ Upload & Indexing berhasil
```

| Endpoint | Method | Fungsi |
|---|---|---|
| `/api/document/documents` | POST | Upload file (hingga 10MB) dan proses Embedding (pgvector) |

---

## 5. Security & Validation

1.  **JWT Authentication Middleware** (`auth.middleware.ts`): Memeriksa keberadaan dan keabsahan token JWT di Header sebelum meloloskan request.
2.  **Zod Validation Middleware** (`validation.middleware.ts`): Memvalidasi tipe dan skema payload request (misal validasi email wajib diisi, validasi skema pesan obrolan).
3.  **CORS**: Diatur di Express untuk membatasi origin spesifik (`ALLOWED_ORIGINS` di `.env`).

---

## 6. Layer Services (Core Business Logic)

Terdapat 8 Service utama di dalam `src/services/` yang menjadi tulang punggung aplikasi saat ini:

1.  **`chat.service.ts`**: Menangani penyusunan pesan sistem obrolan.
2.  **`document-extractor.service.ts`**: Memecah file PDF/dokumen fisik menjadi teks menggunakan Tika atau LlamaParse.
3.  **`embedding.service.ts`**: Menghasilkan representasi vektor teks/chunk dokumen.
4.  **`feedback.service.ts`**: Mengelola _rating_ (jempol atas/bawah) pesan AI dari pengguna.
5.  **`groq.service.ts`**: Klien utama untuk berinteraksi dengan API LLM dari Groq.
6.  **`onyx.service.ts`**: (Pengembangan) Integrasi dengan Onyx AI RAG Platform.
7.  **`rag.service.ts`**: Layanan inti untuk pencarian *Semantic Search* terhadap teks di _database_ yang mirip dengan pertanyaan pengguna.
8.  **`session.service.ts`**: Menyimpan dan melacak riwayat serta konteks obrolan unik tiap pengguna.

---

## 7. Technology Stack Spesifik

| Layer | Teknologi |
|---|---|
| **Frontend** | Next.js 14, React, Tailwind CSS |
| **Backend** | Express.js, TypeScript, Node.js |
| **Database/ORM** | PostgreSQL via Prisma ORM |
| **Vector Search** | `pgvector` di PostgreSQL |
| **AI/LLM** | Groq API (_gpt-oss-120b_) |
| **Auth** | JWT (JSON Web Tokens), `bcrypt` |
| **File Parser** | Multer, Apache Tika Lokal, LlamaParse |
| **Caching** | Redis (melalui _docker-compose_) |
| **Monitoring Tool** | Logstash/Kibana & Elasticsearch (in _docker-compose_ for infra view) |

---

## 8. Ringkasan Root Folder Project

```
acs-master/ (Backend)
├── src/
│   ├── index.ts              # Entry point Express.js app
│   ├── middleware/           # auth, error, validation middleware
│   ├── routes/               # auth, chat, document, health routes
│   ├── controllers/          # Logika Request & HTTP Response
│   ├── services/             # 8 Core Business Logic Services
│   ├── validation/           # Zod schema validation
│   └── workers/              # Background Task Handlers
├── prisma/                   # schema.prisma (Postgres + pgvector)
└── docker-compose.yml        # Redis, Elasticsearch, Kibana, Tika

acs-frontend/ (Frontend)
├── app/
│   ├── page.tsx              # Landing page
│   ├── login/                # Auth halaman
│   └── analyst-workspace/    # Main Chat Workspace GUI
├── components/               # Komponen AI Model & UI Shadcn
├── hooks/                    # useChat.ts, useRAG.ts, useSession.ts
└── types/                    # Tipe Data TypeScript
```
